# Sofia AI (Cursor)

This repo is **Sofia AI**: AI phone secretary for local businesses (Laval / Montreal). Full project rules, stack, and protocols are in **`CLAUDE.md`** at the repo root.

**Claude Code agent personas** (YAML frontmatter + instructions) live in **`.claude/agents/`** — architect, designer, principal-engineer, coder, critic, devils-advocate, note-taker, secretary.

**Session / memory files:** `HANDOFF.md` (last session), `DECISION.md` when the architect escalates (create at root when needed).

When helping here, follow the non‑negotiables in `CLAUDE.md` (no secrets in git, Twilio webhook signature validation, structured logging, feature branches, etc.). Treat this repo as the **control plane** (agents + decisions); product areas may later become **submodules** — see **Repository strategy** in `CLAUDE.md`.
